  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 - security and correctness hardening ahead of public launch: members-only boards excluded from search/feeds/sitemap and public listings, password-reset fallback gated to development, moderation now runs on edits and direct messages, per-IP throttles on account endpoints, backoffice APIs require Community section access, domain-relative link fixes, and a configurable canonical base URL for emailed links (Community:Auth:BaseUrl). See CHANGELOG.md for the full list.",
